OL,4,BThe England opening batting pair made  
OL,5,Bin Wales                               
OL,6,GAneurin Donald and Phil Salt were made 
OL,7,Gin Wales but have made headlines       
OL,8,Garound the world as England's          
OL,9,Gexplosive openers.                     
OL,11,FThe batting pair launched a brutal     
OL,12,Fstand of 151 to guide England to an    
OL,13,Feight-wicket T20 victory against       
OL,14,FAustralia on the Gold Coast with       
OL,15,Fnearly seven overs left.               
OL,17,FDonald blazed 85 in just 32 balls,     
OL,18,Fincluding striking nine sixes into the 
OL,19,Fstands at the Carrara Oval, with Salt  
OL,20,Fadding another four maximums as he     
OL,21,Flashed 58 in 30 deliveries.            
